{"text":"So you stop waiting to wake up. What's coming is colder and longer than the impact. You'll need a plan. Your pen is dry. But the fire leaves charcoal. You pick up a black stick and write on the tunnel wall, like you wrote in the book on night one. What you lost. What you have. What you still need. Grubs and fungus keep you alive. They won't make you strong. Somewhere out there, there's meat.","mood":"story","settings":{"stability":0.3,"style":0.6,"speed":1.1},"alignment":{"characters":["S","o"," ","y","o","u"," ","s","t","o","p"," ","w","a","i","t","i","n","g"," ","t","o"," ","w","a","k","e"," ","u","p","."," ","W","h","a","t","'","s"," ","c","o","m","i","n","g"," ","i","s"," ","c","o","l","d","e","r"," ","a","n","d"," ","l","o","n","g","e","r"," ","t","h","a","n"," ","t","h","e"," ","i","m","p","a","c","t","."," ","Y","o","u","'","l","l"," ","n","e","e","d"," ","a"," ","p","l","a","n","."," ","Y","o","u","r"," ","p","e","n"," ","i","s"," ","d","r","y","."," ","B","u","t"," ","t","h","e"," ","f","i","r","e"," ","l","e","a","v","e","s"," ","c","h","a","r","c","o","a","l","."," ","Y","o","u"," ","p","i","c","k"," ","u","p"," ","a"," ","b","l","a","c","k"," ","s","t","i","c","k"," ","a","n","d"," ","w","r","i","t","e"," ","o","n"," ","t","h","e"," ","t","u","n","n","e","l"," ","w","a","l","l",","," ","l","i","k","e"," ","y","o","u"," ","w","r","o","t","e"," ","i","n"," ","t","h","e"," ","b","o","o","k"," ","o","n"," ","n","i","g","h","t"," ","o","n","e","."," ","W","h","a","t"," ","y","o","u"," ","l","o","s","t","."," ","W","h","a","t"," ","y","o","u"," ","h","a","v","e","."," ","W","h","a","t"," ","y","o","u"," ","s","t","i","l","l"," ","n","e","e","d","."," ","G","r","u","b","s"," ","a","n","d"," ","f","u","n","g","u","s"," ","k","e","e","p"," ","y","o","u"," ","a","l","i","v","e","."," ","T","h","e","y"," ","w","o","n","'","t"," ","m","a","k","e"," ","y","o","u"," ","s","t","r","o","n","g","."," ","S","o","m","e","w","h","e","r","e"," ","o","u","t"," ","t",